--TEST--
a class with a parent that writes `implements Revocable` reports E1001 on the interface's name, and the message names the parent class, `rule:classes/revocable-objects`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Blog;

use Revocable;

class Storable {}

class Post extends Storable implements Revocable {}
--REQUEST--
diagnostics
--EXPECT--
8:40-8:49 error E1001 `Blog\Post` cannot implement `Revocable`, because its parent class `Blog\Storable` does not.
